1
00:00:02,279 --> 00:00:09,130
Lesson 18. Everyone bakes cookies. Bob tells his family the cookies are selling well.

2
00:00:09,740 --> 00:00:16,910
He asks his kids to help bake more cookies for tomorrow. Nicole says she's too busy to lend a hand.

3
00:00:18,359 --> 00:00:20,369
The cookies are selling like hotcakes.

4
00:00:20,519 --> 00:00:21,250
Way to go, Dad.

5
00:00:21,699 --> 00:00:26,269
I need your kids to help out tonight with the cookies. We need another thousand by morning.

6
00:00:26,839 --> 00:00:30,229
One thousand by tomorrow morning? That's impossible.

7
00:00:30,760 --> 00:00:34,850
Amber and I will end a hand. She's a real night owl, so she won't mind staying up late.

8
00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:37,390
Nicole, we'll need your help too.

9
00:00:37,979 --> 00:00:41,649
Bake cookies the night before the elections? Nothing doing.

10
00:00:42,060 --> 00:00:46,589
Lighten up big shot. You're running for high school president, not president of the United States.

11
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:49,710
Ted, you really get on my nerves sometimes.

12
00:00:50,200 --> 00:00:53,890
Okay kids, let's stop fooling around. We need to get the show on the road.

13
00:00:56,119 --> 00:00:57,030
We need to get the show on the road.

